exports[`editorial templates > clashes-bcf > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 23 · 13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Trades and coordinators · From: Marta Vidal

FOUR ISSUES ARE DUE THIS WEEK

37 clashes remain open after Wednesday’s run (20 mm tolerance, duplicates grouped). These are the ones blocking the review on the 23rd.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · BY DISCIPLINE PAIR

- EST × MEP: 27 → 21 · Instal·lacions Garraf · Due 20.11
- ARQ × EST: 13 → 9 · Ferrer Arquitectura · Due 18.11
- ARQ × MEP: 9 → 7 · Instal·lacions Garraf · Due 20.11

02 · BCF ISSUES DUE

- [MEP] BCF-0412 Ø160 collector passes through beam V-PB-14 (Open) · GF · grid C / 3 · Instal·lacions Garraf · 20.11
- [EST] BCF-0415 Opening in beam V-PB-12 not confirmed (In review) · GF · grid D / 2 · Estructuras EGS · 18.11
- [ARQ] BCF-0398 Ceiling clashes with cable tray (Open) · L1 · corridor grid B · Ferrer Arquitectura · 18.11
- [MEP] BCF-0377 Sprinkler under stair girder (Closed) · L2 · stair 1 · Instal·lacions Garraf · 13.11

Open the issues in the viewer: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-bcf
The full BCF 2.1 is on the CDE: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-CR-B-0046.

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

