'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Date</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">5 Dec 2026</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Code</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px e-bd-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:14px 44px 26px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:11px/17px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona<br>You get this as an agent on the project. <a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc" class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table><!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]--></td></tr></table></body></html>"`;

exports[`editorial templates > closeout > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 24 · 5 Dec 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Management · From: Marta Vidal

DETAILED DESIGN: CLOSED ON TIME

The phase was delivered on 13 November, the contract date. Coordination took 410 hours, 8 % fewer than on Can Rull, mostly because clashes were run weekly instead of monthly.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura
- Coordination hours: 410 (−8 %)
- Clashes resolved: 112
- Health Score: 82 (+18)

01 · THREE LESSONS

- 01: Set the clash tolerance at the first meeting: we lost two weeks arguing 10 or 20 mm.
- 02: Check the IDS on every upload, not at the end: property failures dropped by 70 %.
- 03: Trades answer sooner when the email shows only what is theirs.
“Next time, the BIM execution plan is signed before the services trade is appointed.” — Pau Ferrer, managing partner

Full phase report: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?report=llv-ped

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 5 Dec 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

