exports[`editorial templates > eir-reminder > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 23 · 13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Fusteria Metàl·lica Besòs (FAC) · From: Marta Vidal

THREE REQUIREMENTS TO FIX BEFORE P02 IS ACCEPTED

We checked LLV-FMB-ZZ-ZZ-M3-F-0001 P02 against EIR_Llevant_v3.ids. The geometry is fine; what is missing is information on 47 elements.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura
Health Score: 64 (+6) · measured with EIR_Llevant_v3.ids · FAC · 38 requirements 92.1 %

01 · WHAT FAILS

EIR_Llevant_v3.ids · LLV-FMB-ZZ-ZZ-M3-F-0001 P02
- Pset_WindowCommon.FireRating required on stair openings: 12 Elements (IfcWindow, e.g. 2fXk$9Hq…)
- Pset_WindowCommon.ThermalTransmittance ≤ 1.6 W/m²K: 28 Elements (IfcWindow, e.g. 0Lm7Qe2r…)
- Uniclass 2015 classification Pr_30_59: 7 Elements (IfcCurtainWall, e.g. 3tYb8aNv…)

02 · WHAT IS YOURS

[ ] Fill in the three properties and export IFC 4 again — Fusteria Metàl·lica Besòs — Fri 21 Nov
[ ] Upload P03 to the CDE; it is checked on arrival — Fusteria Metàl·lica Besòs — Fri 21 Nov

See the 47 elements: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-fac-ids
The full IDS is on the CDE: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-SP-B-0003.

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

