exports[`editorial templates > milestone-cert > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 23 · 13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Promocions Llevant SL · From: Marta Vidal

DETAILED DESIGN, DELIVERED AND CHECKED

Today we close milestone 3. The architecture, structure and services models are federated, checked against each other and against the information requirements in the contract. They are ready for pricing.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · VALIDATION CERTIFICATE

Health Score: 91 · measured with EIR_Llevant_v3.ids · 312 requirements 99.1 %
[South elevation, federated model P05]
Open this view: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-south

02 · WHERE WE ARE

● 03.2026 Concept design
● 06.2026 Planning application
● 13.11.2026 Detailed design
◐ 12.2026 Construction tender
○ 03.2027 Start on site
“What we deliver today is what will be built. Every change from here on will have a date, an author and a reason.” — Marta Vidal

See the model and the certificate: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-cert
Nothing to install: it opens in the browser.

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
