o','Courier New',monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;">91</p></td><td class="st bl e-bd-hair" style="border-left:1px solid #d6d4ce;padding:18px 20px;" valign="top"><p class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;margin:0;font:13px/20px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">medido con</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:13px/20px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">EIR_Llevant_v3.ids</p><p class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;margin:10px 0 0;font:13px/20px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><b class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;">312</b> requisitos · <b class="e-ok" style="color:#206b38;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;">99,1 %</b></p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:28px 0 0"><a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-south"><img class="img" src="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/images/mail/sample-capture.jpg" width="640" height="300" alt="Fachada sur, modelo federado P05" style="width:640px;height:300px;max-width:100%;"></a></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:0 44px 8px"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;padding:8px 0 0;font:italic 13px/19px Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">Fachada sur, modelo federado P05</td><td align="right" valign="top" style="padding:8px 0 0 12px;white-space:nowrap"><a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-south" class="e-accent" style="color:#00696a;font:700 11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;text-decoration:underline;">Abrir esta vista →</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px e-bd-hair" style="border-top:1px solid #d6d4ce;padding:36px 44px 14px;"><p class="e-accent" style="color:#00696a;margin:0;font:11px/16px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.14em;">02</p><h2 class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:4px 0 0