r style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold">Ver el modelo y el certificado</center></v:rect><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-cert" style="display:inline-block;background:#00696a;color:#ffffff;font:700 14px/20px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:14px 26px;text-decoration:none;">Ver el modelo y el certificado</a><!--<![endif]--><p class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;margin:14px 0 0;font:13px/18px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">No necesitas instalar nada: se abre en el navegador.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="height:30px;line-height:30px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="e-bd-rule" style="border-top:2px solid #1c1b16;"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" class="st" style="padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Proyecto</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">Residencial Llevant · 84 viviendas</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Fase</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">Proyecto de ejecución</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Rev.</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">P05</p></td></tr><tr><td valign="top" class="st e-bd-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Autor</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Fecha</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">13.11.2026</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Código</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px e-bd-rule" style="border-top:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:14px 44px 26px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:11px/17px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona<br>Lo recibes como agente del proyecto. <a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc" class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;text-decoration:underline;">Darte de baja</a></p></td></tr></table><!--[if mso]></td></tr