exports[`editorial templates > monthly > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 11 · November 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Client and project team · From: Marta Vidal

A MONTH TO CLOSE THE DESIGN

November was the month of clashes: we started with 112 and end with 37, all minor and all owned. The model is ready to tender and the programme holds.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · THE MONTH IN FIGURES

- Clashes resolved: 75
- Model Health Score: 82 (+11)
- Days of delay: 0
[South elevation with the new aluminium frames]
Open this view: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-south

02 · ONE DECISION FOR DECEMBER

The south façade frames can move to mid-range thermally broken aluminium. It saves about €38,000 and keeps the A energy rating. We need your answer by 12 December to include it in the tender.

03 · WHAT COMES NEXT

◐ 12.12 Decision on window frames
○ 15.12 Tender issued
○ 30.01 Bids received

Open the project: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 30 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

