exports[`editorial templates > new-version > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 23 · 13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Instal·lacions Garraf (MEP) · From: Marta Vidal

ARCHITECTURE PUBLISHES P05: SIX CHANGES TOUCH YOUR ROUTES

Of the 41 changes between P04 and P05, six cross your services. The rest do not affect you and need no review.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · WHAT CHANGES FOR MEP

- [ARQ] P2 · ejes B–C / 3 P04→P05: Bathroom partition moved 35 cm: check stacks BV-07 and BV-08
- [ARQ] P3 · eje D / 2 P04→P05: New 60 × 40 cm shaft next to stair 2
- [ARQ] P4 · ejes A–B / 4 P04→P05: Kitchen ceiling lowered from 2.60 to 2.50 m
- [ARQ] PB · eje C / 1 P04→P05: Meter room: EI2 60 door now opens outwards
[L3 · grid D / 2 · new shaft in P05]
Open this view: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-shaft

02 · WHAT IS YOURS

[ ] Reroute BV-07 and BV-08 into the new shaft — Instal·lacions Garraf — Thu 20 Nov
[ ] Lower kitchen ducts on L4 to +2.45 m — Instal·lacions Garraf — Thu 20 Nov
[ ] Upload P06 to the CDE named LLV-IGA-ZZ-ZZ-M3-M-0001 — Instal·lacions Garraf — Fri 21 Nov

See the 6 changes in 3D: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-diff-mep

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

