9;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;&#8199;&#65279;&#847;</div><table role="presentation" width="100%" class="e-bg-canvas" style="background:#ecebe6;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px 0"><!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="640" align="center"><tr><td><![endif]--><table role="presentation" width="640" class="w e-bg-paper" style="background:#fbfaf7;width:640px;max-width:640px;"><tr><td class="px" style="padding:28px 44px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;font:11px/16px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">No. 23 · RFI-031</td><td align="right" class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;font:11px/16px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;">13 Nov 2026</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:24px 44px 22px;text-align:center"><p class="e-ink e-mast" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:0;font:400 52px/56px Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;letter-spacing:-.01em;">Llevant 84</p><p class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;margin:8px 0 0;font:italic 15px/21px Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;">BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:0 44px"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td class="e-bd-rule" style="border-top:3px double #1c1b16;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px e-bg-band" style="background:#f1f0ec;padding:10px 44px;"><span class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;font:11px/17px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">For&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;font:700 11px/17px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Procurement and site management</span><span class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;font:11px/17px Cons