</td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:22px 44px 8px"><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:0;font:15px/24px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Coordination recommendation: option A. It is cheaper, keeps the car-park clearance, and structure has already checked it in preliminary calculation.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:30px 44px 10px"><div style="text-align:center"><!--[if mso]><v:rect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?rfi=031" style="height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:300px" stroke="f" fillcolor="#00696a"><center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold">Answer the RFI</center></v:rect><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?rfi=031" style="display:inline-block;background:#00696a;color:#ffffff;font:700 14px/20px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:14px 26px;text-decoration:none;">Answer the RFI</a><!--<![endif]--></div></td></tr><tr><td style="height:30px;line-height:30px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="e-bd-rule" style="border-top:2px solid #1c1b16;"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" class="st" style="padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Project</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">Llevant Residential · 84 homes</p></td><td valign="top" class="st bl e-bd-rule" style="border-left:1px solid #1c1b16;padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Phase</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;margin:2px 0 0;font:11px/15px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-brea