exports[`editorial templates > weekly > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 23 · W46 · 9–13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Coordinators and BIM managers · From: Marta Vidal

37 OPEN CLASHES (−12). DRAINAGE × GROUND-FLOOR BEAMS STILL CRITICAL.

Federation P05 goes from 49 to 37 open clashes. The drainage network crossing the ground-floor beams is still the critical point before the revision closes on Monday 23.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · FEDERATED MODEL P05

Health Score: 82 (+4) · measured with EIR_Llevant_v3.ids · 312 requirements 96.4 %
- Open clashes: 37 (−12)
- BCF new / closed: 14 / 22
- IDS requirements: 96.4 % (+1.8)

02 · CLASHES BY DISCIPLINE PAIR

- EST × MEP: 27 → 21 · Instal·lacions Garraf · Due 20.11
- ARQ × EST: 13 → 9 · Ferrer Arquitectura · Due 18.11
- ARQ × MEP: 9 → 7 · Instal·lacions Garraf · Due 20.11

03 · MODEL VIEW

[South elevation · Ground floor · Federated P05 · 11 elements without FireRating highlighted]
Open this view: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05-south

04 · ACTIONS · OWNER · DATE

[ ] Resolve 14 drainage crossings with beams on grids C–D / 2–4 — Instal·lacions Garraf — Thu 20 Nov
[ ] Confirm openings in beams V-PB-12 to V-PB-17 — Estructuras EGS — Tue 18 Nov
[ ] Add FireRating to 11 stair IfcDoor — Ferrer Arquitectura — Tue 18 Nov

05 · VERSION LOG

- [ARQ] LLV-FER-ZZ-ZZ-M3-A-0001 P04→P05: 18 partitions moved on levels 2–4
- [EST] LLV-EGS-ZZ-ZZ-M3-S-0001 P03→P04: Ground-floor downstand beams, depth 60 → 55 cm
- [MEP] LLV-IGA-ZZ-ZZ-M3-M-0001 P05→P06: Suspended drainage, new route on grid C

Open federated P05: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv-p05
Coordination meeting: Monday 23 Nov, 10:00, room 2 / Jitsi

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

