exports[`editorial templates > welcome > en: plain text snapshot 1`] = `
"LLEVANT 84 · No. 1 · 13 Nov 2026
BIM coordination bulletin · Llevant Residential · 84 homes
For: Fusteria Metàl·lica Besòs · From: Marta Vidal

WELCOME TO THE LLEVANT 84 TEAM

You join as the façade and window trade. Here is everything you need for your first delivery to be accepted first time.
— Marta Vidal, BIM Coordinator · Ferrer Arquitectura

01 · HOW FILES ARE NAMED

- LLV: Project
- FMB: Your originator code (Fusteria Metàl·lica Besòs)
- ZZ-ZZ: Volume and level: whole building
- M3: Type: 3D model
- F: Role: façades
- LLV-FMB-ZZ-ZZ-M3-F-0001: This is your model’s name

02 · DELIVERY RULES

- IFC 4: Reference View, project coordinates (ETRS89 / UTM 31N), units in metres.
- EIR v3: Requirements in EIR_Llevant_v3.ids; every upload is checked on arrival.
- Fridays: Weekly deliveries before 14:00; the clash run is on Wednesday.

03 · WHO TO ASK

- BIM: Marta Vidal · m.vidal@ferrerarquitectura.cat
- Site: Jordi Puig · 600 412 908

Open the federated model: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv
First delivery expected: Friday 28 Nov.

—
Project: Llevant Residential · 84 homes · Phase: Detailed design · Rev. P05
Author: Marta Vidal · Ferrer Arquitectura · Date: 13 Nov 2026 · Code: LLV-FER-ZZ-XX-RP-B-0023
Ferrer Arquitectura · C/ de Mar 41, 08911 Badalona
You get this as an agent on the project. Unsubscribe: https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/u/abc
"
`;

