ss="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;font:14px/21px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Marta Vidal · m.vidal@ferrerarquitectura.cat</span></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td class="st" width="34%" valign="top" class="e-bd-hair" style="border-bottom:1px solid #d6d4ce;padding:10px 12px 10px 0;"><span class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;font:700 12px/19px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;word-break:break-all;">Obra</span></td><td class="st" valign="top" class="e-bd-hair" style="border-bottom:1px solid #d6d4ce;padding:10px 0;"><span class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b16;font:14px/21px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Jordi Puig · 600 412 908</span></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class="px" style="padding:30px 44px 10px"><div style="text-align:center"><!--[if mso]><v:rect xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv" style="height:48px;v-text-anchor:middle;width:300px" stroke="f" fillcolor="#00696a"><center style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold">Abrir el modelo federado</center></v:rect><![endif]--><!--[if !mso]><!--><a href="https://www.ifcvieweronline.eu/?v=llv" style="display:inline-block;background:#00696a;color:#ffffff;font:700 14px/20px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;padding:14px 26px;text-decoration:none;">Abrir el modelo federado</a><!--<![endif]--><p class="e-dim" style="color:#4e4d48;margin:14px 0 0;font:13px/18px Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Primera entrega esperada: viernes 28.11.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td style="height:30px;line-height:30px;font-size:0">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="e-bd-rule" style="border-top:2px solid #1c1b16;"><table role="presentation" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" class="st" style="padding:8px 12px;"><p class="e-faint" style="color:#65635e;margin:0;font:9px/12px Consolas,Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono','Courier New',monospace;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Proyecto</p><p class="e-ink" style="color:#1c1b